				<p style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
					We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal data:
				</p>
				<ul style="margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">SSL/TLS encryption on all data in transit (enforced HTTPS)</li>
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Cloudflare security infrastructure including DDoS protection, Web Application Firewall (WAF), and bot management</li>
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Access controls limiting data access to authorised personnel only</li>
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Regular review of third-party data processors' security practices</li>
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Secure deletion of data at end of retention period</li>
					<li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">No storage of payment card data on our systems</li>
				</ul>
				<p style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
